# V2 telemetry (must implement)

V1 hides metrics we do not collect. Do not add placeholder tiles like "— / not collected yet".

When working on V2 (or if the user asks to monitor these), implement them for real, then unhide in the UI.

## Rule for new gaps

If something is not monitored, keep the types/API hooks if useful, hide it in the UI, and add it to this list instead of showing empty placeholders.
